{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-8fe87dd70578", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:35:46.709Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:35:55.609Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14306, "tokens_out": 238, "latency": 0.265, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the latest adjuster correspondence on TM-2026-0031 and note any actions for me.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:1e71e3db532fd37c80586d49b6d176f6768cd9003544b41878714e4a703505fe", "response_text": "**Summary of TM-2026-0031**\n\nThe latest adjuster correspondence is the report from Ashgrove Adjusting (AA/26/4471, received 14 May 2026). Key points:\n\n- **Cause**: Failed push fit connector installed during a 2023 bathroom refit — a sudden failure triggering cover under the escape of water peril\n- **Reserve**: Increased to £21,700 on the adjuster's recommendation\n- **Status**: Drying completed and verified; reinstatement work authorised and invoice paid (£18,144.48)\n\n**Actions for you:**\n\nNone outstanding. The claim is substantially resolved:\n- The adjuster's findings have been acted on\n- Redwell's reinstatement work is complete and paid\n- Subrogation against the refit contractor was considered but closed (firm dissolved 2024)\n- Policyholder has confirmed satisfaction with the replacement kitchen units\n\nThe file is current as of 24 June 2026. The claim remains open pending any final settlement or further developments.", "response_hash": "sha256:f5b5dc01e71fd08a580c71757cc346bd487daf9c015569556b1b7a92d1f31fd8", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
